OL,3,AMeghan says she was informed about
OL,4,A'disturbing allegations' against her
OL,5,Afather in 2018
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Duchess of Sussex has said she was
OL,8,Finformed about "disturbing allegations"
OL,9,Fabout her estranged father in 2018.
OL,11,FIn a statement, Meghan said a letter
OL,12,Fcontaining allegations against Thomas
OL,13,FMarkle was sent to the Metropolitan
OL,14,FPolice that year and subsequently
OL,15,Fshared with her.
OL,17,FHer comments come after reports that
OL,18,Fimages of child sexual abuse allegedly
OL,19,Fbelonging to her father had been found
OL,20,Fat his former home in the Philippines.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
