OL,3,ABurnham suggests stocking up on tinned
OL,4,Afood and bottled water
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurnham added: "It's not about
OL,7,Fpanicking... It's about just taking
OL,8,Fsensible measures to have enough in the
OL,9,Fhouse to tide you over should there be
OL,10,Fa difficult situation."
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
