OL,3,AStrong wind and rain forecast as
OL,4,Aback-to-back storms hit UK this weekend
OL,5,
OL,6,FMillions remain under yellow weather
OL,7,Fwarnings for wind and rain, with a
OL,8,Fsecond storm, named Boelo, expected to
OL,9,Fhit the UK on Saturday
OL,11,FOne man tells us he was evacuated from
OL,12,Fa motorway service station near
OL,13,FBicester after it was hit by a power
OL,14,Fcut, while Sara Gatland in Guernsey
OL,15,Fsays her flight home to Edinburgh was
OL,16,Fcancelled due to the stormy weather
OL,18,FRail lines will close from 21:00 in
OL,19,Fpart of Scotland on Saturday, according
OL,20,Fto Network Rail, while people are being
OL,21,Fadvised to avoid all travel unless
OL,22,Fnecessary
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
