OL,3,AIsraeli forces begin demolishing
OL,4,APalestinian buildings in Hebron after
OL,5,Atwo Israeli soldiers shot dead
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Israeli military has begun
OL,8,Fdemolishing Palestinian buildings in
OL,9,Fthe city of Hebron, after two Israeli
OL,10,Fsoldiers were killed in an attack by
OL,11,Ftwo Palestinian gunmen.
OL,13,FPrime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu said
OL,14,Fthe military would "destroy" the
OL,15,Fneighbourhood where the two attackers
OL,16,Fcame from, and that Israel was ready
OL,17,Ffor "extensive action" in the occupied
OL,18,FWest Bank.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
