OL,3,AWhite House says Melania Trump brokers
OL,4,Atruce for Ukraine city 'on brink of
OL,5,Adisaster'
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS First Lady Melania Trump has
OL,8,F"successfully secured" a ceasefire
OL,9,Fbetween Russia and Ukraine in the
OL,10,FRussian-occupied city of Oleshky, the
OL,11,FWhite House has said.
OL,13,FIt said the truce in the "front-line
OL,14,Fwar city on the brink of disaster"
OL,15,Fwithout medicine, food and clean water
OL,16,Fwould begin on 29 October.
OL,18,FUkraine and Russia confirmed the deal
OL,19,Fwas agreed to evacuate residents and
OL,20,Fdeliver aid. Moscow said its forces
OL,21,Fwould stop firing at 04:00 (02:00 GMT)
OL,22,Fon 27 October.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
